  abstract = {We aim to achieve the following three goals. First of all, we collect all known definitions, transformation properties and functional identities of Barnes double gamma function $G(z;τ)$. Second, we derive an algorithm for numerically computing the double gamma function and present its complete asymptotic expansion as $z\to \infty$. Third, we derive some new properties, including a new product identity and new representations of the gamma modular forms $C(τ)$ and $D(τ)$.},
